  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The power emitted by a spherical black body at absolute temperature T is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The absolute temperature of the black body is halved and its radius is doubled so that the power emitted becomes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P'\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{P'}{P}\"></span> ? <br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{16}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{8}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li></ol>"
